of common stock<B> </B>upon the exercise of certain warrants issued by the Company in May 2026 in connection with a licensing transaction and related private placement. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
